          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I cawa meno luparicayo mogo gubino, guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Cit woko ki kany, pien Kerode mito neki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yecu odok iye botgi ni, “Wucit, wuwac bot too can ni, ‘Nen, abiryemo cen dok abicaŋo dano tin ki diki, i nino me adekke abicobone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bed kit meno, myero amedde gira ki wotta, tin ki diki ki diki maca; pien lanebi pe myero oto ka mukene ma pe i Jerucalem.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerucalem, Jerucalem, in ma ineko lunebi, ma icelo dano ma gioro boti woko ki got, tyen adi ma nene amito coko litinoni woko, macalo min gweno coko litinone i te bwome, ento wun pe wuye giwu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
